1
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Meet Rachael, a front desk staff member helping Ritu with a hospital insurance claim.

2
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:43,000
ClaimReady keeps the claim documents and follow-up work together in one place.

3
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Rachael starts a claim check by entering the claim details and adding the available files.

4
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:13,000
The app reads the documents and checks for missing information or details that may need review.

5
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:30,000
These are review prompts for staff. Rachael checks the source documents before taking action.

6
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The insurer asks for more information, so Rachael records the request and its due date in Query Desk.

7
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Query Desk finds relevant details in the claim files and prepares a response draft with file references.

8
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Rachael reviews the draft, edits it if needed, then marks the query responded after sending it.

9
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Later, the insurer sends a remittance advice showing how the claim was settled.

10
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Rachael uploads the advice. ClaimReady uses the configured local AI model to suggest the settlement amounts.

11
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:40,000
The staff member should check the suggested amounts against the insurer advice before saving.

12
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:55,000
The claim was ₹45,000, but ₹40,000 was received. The ₹5,000 difference still needs explanation.

13
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:02,000
Next, staff should confirm the reason before recording any deduction.

